# An allowlist. Everything is excluded first and only what the image build
# needs is let back in, so a file nobody thought about (a real bundle, a
# workbook, an .env) never reaches the build at all, rather than relying on
# someone to have listed it here.
#
# scripts/__tests__/container.test.mjs asserts the shape of this file, and the
# Image workflow plants decoys in public/data before building to prove it.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!tsconfig.json
!vite.config.ts
!vitest.config.ts
!playwright.config.ts
!playwright.standalone.config.ts
!src/
!e2e/
!public/
!fixtures/synthetic/
!deploy/nginx/

# The scripts the build runs, one by one, rather than the directory.
!scripts/seed-data.mjs
!scripts/write-notice.mjs
!scripts/check-offline.mjs
!scripts/check-image-data.mjs

# write-notice.mjs --check reads the notice blocks in these two.
!README.md
!docs/data-inputs.md

# The bundle directory. public/ is needed for the favicon; the bundle inside it
# is generated, gitignored, and where a real one gets built. The image seeds
# its own from fixtures/synthetic instead.
public/data/

# tsc type-checks e2e/, but it does not need 13 MB of baseline screenshots.
e2e/__screenshots__/

# The same raw-material and secrets rules as .gitignore, applied inside the
# directories let back in above.
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xlsm
**/*.xls
**/*.gexf
**/*.graphml
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules/
